 pilgrimage to the House - for whoever is able to find thereto a way. But whoever disbelieves [i.e., refuses] - then indeed, Allāh is free from need of the worlds.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":97,"sd":null},{"k":"3:98","t":"Say, \"O People of the Scripture, why do you disbelieve in the verses of Allāh while Allāh is Witness over what you do?\"","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":98,"sd":null},{"k":"3:99","t":"Say, \"O People of the Scripture, why do you avert from the way of Allāh those who believe, seeking to make it [seem] deviant, while you are witnesses [to the truth]? And Allāh is not unaware of what you do.\"","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":99,"sd":null},{"k":"3:100","t":"O you who have believed, if you obey a party of those who were given the Scripture, they would turn you back, after your belief, [to being] unbelievers.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":100,"sd":null}],"juz":3,"hizb":6,"surahs":[3],"sajdah":false}